      "text": "技能、芯片、能力、属性和武器共同扩张时间化身的军械库",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Unlock a variety of skills, chips and abilities to become a force to be reckoned with! Increase your stats, enhance your awesome weapons, and upgrade your massive arsenal of gear to be the ultimate avatar of time!",
